        <AlertDescription>
          <p>High-availability of storage in the infrastructure is left to the underlying storage provider.</p>
        </AlertDescription>
      </Alert>
      <Alert variant="info" class="my-4">
        <AlertTitle>Important</AlertTitle>
        <AlertDescription>
          <p>OpenShift Container Platform 4.12 and later provides automatic migration for the AWS Block in-tree volume plugin to its equivalent CSI driver.</p>
          <p>CSI automatic migration should be seamless. Migration does not change how you use all existing API objects, such as persistent volumes, persistent volume claims, and storage classes. For more information about migration, see CSI automatic migration.</p>
        </AlertDescription>
